auto_grocier_mcp/
------------------

The vendored `auto_grocier_mcp/` package (formerly imported as
`texas_grocery_mcp`) is derived from the open-source project
**texas-grocery-mcp** by Michael Walker:

    https://github.com/mgwalkerjr95/texas-grocery-mcp

The upstream work is licensed under the MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026
Michael Walker. A verbatim copy of the upstream license is included at
`auto_grocier_mcp/LICENSE`.

This copy has been **modified from the original**. Summary of modifications:

  - Added a persisted-query override loader (~40 LOC) in
    `auto_grocier_mcp/clients/graphql.py`, allowing captured GraphQL
    persisted-query hashes to be reloaded at runtime.
  - Added a net-new tool module `auto_grocier_mcp/tools/substitution.py`,
    with a corresponding registration line in
    `auto_grocier_mcp/server.py`.
  - Flattened the source tree out of the upstream `src/` layout; the upstream
    `src/` wrapper, `pyproject.toml`, `uv.lock`, Dockerfile, CHANGELOG,
    CONTRIBUTING, and SECURITY files are not vendored here.

All other files in `auto_grocier_mcp/` remain substantially as published
upstream and retain their original MIT license terms.
